# Astro Church Site Conventions

## Stack
- Astro v5 with static output
- Tailwind CSS via `@astrojs/tailwind`
- TypeScript for logic and shared types

## Architecture
- Keep UI in `src/components` and `src/layouts`
- Keep future data access in `src/lib`
- Keep shared domain types in `src/types`
- Do not implement backend, auth, or event logic in this version

## Validation
- `npm run build` is the acceptance gate
- Prefer simple static pages and minimal client-side JavaScript

## Styling
- Use global semantic classes from `src/styles/global.css` for repeated patterns
- Keep the visual language calm, warm, and institutional
- Avoid SaaS-style interface patterns

